  "notes": [
    "Listed under お取扱い中の商品 on the product page, and new-contract rates are still published each half-month. The insurer's rate hub shows a ＜販売停止＞ heading within this policy form's product list, which most likely refers to the discontinued sibling names (site codes 206, 207). プレミアレシーブ３ launched in November 2026 as the apparent successor; no end-of-sale announcement for プレミアレシーブ２ has been found.",
    "The guarantee period is 10 years for every series (recorded as term_years).",
    "指数プラン pays a lower 定期支払率 and links part of the return to a reference index; index data is not collected.",
    "The same policy form is also sold as プレミアレシーブＭ２ (205), 安心一生涯２ (208) and two discontinued names (206, 207); these are not tracked separately.",
    "MVA rates (市場価格調整用利率) are published per age band but are identical across age bands and across 基本プラン and 指数プラン. Their dates are surrender periods, not new-contract periods.",
    "Launch date: 2024-01-04, the sales start stated in the insurer's news release of 2023-12-26 (id=1032, 『プレミアレシーブ２』, 定期支払金付積立利率変動型終身保険（23）（通貨指定型）). Retrieved 2026-11-17."
  ],
  "notes_en": [
    "Listed as on sale, but its successor Premier Receive 3 launched in November 2026; no end-of-sale notice found.",
    "Launch announced 26 December 2023; rate history starts 1 January 2024.",
    "Guarantee period is 10 years throughout.",
    "The index plan pays a lower periodic payment rate and links part of the return to an index; index data is not collected.",
    "MVA rates are surrender-period rates, identical across age bands and plans."
  ],
